      "expected": "reject",
      "kind": "cpp17-negative",
      "source": "#include <list>\nstruct Entry {\n  int key;\n  int tag;\n  bool operator<(const Entry& other) const {\n    return key < other.key || (key == other.key && tag < other.tag);\n  }\n};\nint main() { return std::list<Entry>{{1, 2}} < std::list<Entry>{{1, 3}}; }\n",
